        "assignee": {
          "name": "Sophos MDR Team"
        },
        "overview": "INCIDENT SUMMARY\n\nAt 01:42 AM, a spearphishing email delivered a malicious Excel macro to sarah.chen (Finance). The macro downloaded a Cobalt Strike beacon establishing C2 with 185.220.101.47. At 02:31 AM, the attacker attempted lateral movement to SRV-FS01 (file server) using stolen svc-backup credentials. At 02:39 AM, ransomware deployment began \u2014 CryptoGuard blocked encryption.\n\nMDR RESPONSE\n\u2022 02:39 AM \u2014 Alert triggered, MDR analyst assigned\n\u2022 02:44 AM \u2014 Lateral movement blocked, SRV-FS01 protected\n\u2022 02:47 AM \u2014 DESKTOP-FIN042 isolated from network\n\u2022 03:15 AM \u2014 C2 IP blocked at firewall (185.220.101.47)\n\u2022 03:30 AM \u2014 Compromised credentials (svc-backup) flagged for reset\n\u2022 04:45 AM \u2014 Full remediation complete: malware removed, persistence cleared\n\u2022 06:00 AM \u2014 Incident report delivered to customer\n\nIMPACT: 1 endpoint compromised (DESKTOP-FIN042). Lateral movement blocked before file server was reached. Zero data loss. Zero files encrypted (CryptoGuard). Estimated attacker dwell time: 57 minutes before containment.\n\nSTATUS: Contained. Awaiting customer approval to bring DESKTOP-FIN042 back online.",
        "detectionCount": 18,
        "escalated": true
      },
